{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quess</strong> is a bold reimagining of three classic board games \u2014 <strong>Chess</strong>, <strong>Checkers</strong>, and <strong>Backgammon</strong> \u2014 redesigned for <strong>4-player battles</strong>, rich with elemental strategy and competitive depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a stylized cosmic universe where ancient elemental beings fight for control of reality, Quess invites you to take part in their eternal contest. Choose your element \u2014 <strong>Earth, Fire, Water, or Air</strong> \u2014 and enter the arena to outsmart, outmaneuver, and outplay your rivals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/2acf43835e816a62dd03399d41cae4ea.avif?t=1766583251\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras_big/2acf43835e816a62dd03399d41cae4ea.avif?t=1766583251 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends or challenge advanced AI bots in fast-paced, turn-based showdowns across beautifully animated 3D boards. Customize your play with <strong>different chess piece styles</strong> (Traditional, Chinese, or French) and unlock visual flourishes that reflect your chosen element.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/1f6c557c557c9ee95370623386a47ad9.avif?t=1766583251\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras_big/1f6c557c557c9ee95370623386a47ad9.avif?t=1766583251 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Three Games, One Universe</strong><br>Enjoy 4-player variants of Chess, Checkers, and Backgammon \u2014 each uniquely adapted for modern, multiplayer play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Elemental Identity</strong><br>Select your element at the start of each match. Each element is visually represented through your pieces and throne.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Multiplayer &amp; AI</strong><br>Play online with friends or go solo against smart AI-controlled opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Stylized 3D Graphics</strong><br>Experience visually rich game boards, dynamic VFX, and immersive ambient design inspired by cosmic mythologies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9 <strong>Lore-Driven Intro Cinematic</strong><br>Dive into the mythic backstory of Quess through a beautifully crafted opening sequence that sets the stakes of the game.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.poster.avif?t=1766583251\" width=450 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.webm?t=1766583251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/extras/0b2c9db2a564f3fbed6ef50a077520a4.mp4?t=1766583251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a board game veteran or a newcomer seeking a new strategic challenge, <i>Quess</i> offers a fresh, competitive spin on time-honored classics \u2014 now reimagined for the multiverse.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962760?t=1766583251","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962760/c88bdd774fc43dbef5c0f0f9d57f10803de08ace/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766583251","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com